{"overview":"مو دوک یک جنگجور ماهر است که روحش در بدنی ضعیف گرفتار شده.  جانگ ووک که از خانواده ای نجیب است به طور اتفاقی با مو دوک یی آشنا می شود که از او می‌خواهد برای تغییر سرنوشتش به او کمک کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"She was named Naksu because wherever she went, a trail of heads followed. She performs the alchemy of souls, magic that can change people's bodies and souls, which is forbidden in Daeho, and ends up being chased. Naksu hurriedly abandons her body and attempts the alchemy of souls on a woman passing by. Jang Wook, the son of the King of Daeho, realizes that Mudeok's soul has been changed and helps her. Jang Wook wants to learn Naksu's martial arts and become a sorcerer, and Naksu, in the body of Mudeok, stays by his side so she can recover her strength.","tagline_en":"Stay close, so no one can attack us!","runtime":75,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2022,"poster":"/bl8c0iKCXcdoEZdFRl1d1U4i0qJ.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2022,"poster":"/9bVZVu4TCLfNxQ32uyK4eD6IQ5d.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2022,"poster":"/3Nah0tLkmjRO00H60mLKPDmLcPd.jpg"}],"episodes":30,"crew":["홍정은","홍미란","박준화"],"crew_en":["Hong Jeong-eun","Hong Mi-ran","Park Joon-hwa"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"이재욱","role":"Jang Uk","photo":"/rGGgDCNlbTwENUXXlBD3g9bJDQj.jpg","en":"Lee Jae-wook"},{"name":"고윤정","role":"Naksu / Cho-young / Jin Bu-yeon","photo":"/1AlwvzW8dUvJXreVvzyTXsa6FOh.jpg","en":"Go Youn-jung"},{"name":"황민현","role":"Seo Yul","photo":"/v5EwxluES8RZ8O4eErTz0r9lDJ5.jpg","en":"Minhyun"},{"name":"문성현","role":"Seo Yul (teen)","photo":"/jInMm61oJJOB9w9Pm8F3HmkYMKz.jpg","en":"Moon Seong-hyun"},{"name":"신승호","role":"Crown Prince Go Won","photo":"/6Ca6UNuwVmHPIVGIPQuChOp7oJp.jpg","en":"Shin Seung-ho"},{"name":"유준상","role":"Park Jin","photo":"/sRI7h5AsI9RMMvQWM4ef560aAeY.jpg","en":"Yu Jun-sang"},{"name":"오나라","role":"Maid Kim Do-ju","photo":"/vGlPj4WSM0z5J1ZLIX5Y40MXJV8.jpg","en":"Oh Na-ra"},{"name":"유인수","role":"Park D